[Binary PNG file representing subgroup comparison plot]
This figure shows the correlation coefficient and p-value across continental
ancestry groups (EUR, AFR, EAS, SAS, AMR) for the mitochondrial heteroplasmy
burden vs age analysis.

X-axis: Ancestry Group
Y-axis: Spearman Correlation Coefficient
Error bars: 95% Confidence Intervals

Key findings:
- All ancestry groups show positive correlation
- EUR and AMR show strongest correlations
- AFR shows slightly weaker but still positive correlation
- No significant heterogeneity across groups
